## 3. Population maj3 race (LS, exact on {-1,1}^5, toy library, depth <= 3)
 event 1: t/Theta = 2.0000; 9 syntactic gates fire (9 distinct functions up to sign), |U| = [0.5]; depths [1]; cumulative distinct = 9; train residual ||r|| = 0.5000; kappa(pop) = 3.000
   after event 1: max |S|/Theta of unfired candidates = 0.5000 (claim: <= 1/2)
   refit f = (x1+x2+x3)/2 ? max|f - (x1+x2+x3)/2| = 1.78e-15
   residual utilities after event 1: max over depth-1 = 0.0000, max over depth-2 = 0.2500, #depth-2 candidates attaining it = 12
 event 2: t/Theta = 6.0000; 12 syntactic gates fire (12 distinct functions up to sign), |U| = [0.25]; depths [2]; cumulative distinct = 21; train residual ||r|| = 0.0000; kappa(pop) = 5.303
   race stopped: all utilities zero

